=== 4. the FKG hair: pairwise positive correlation does NOT give the product bound ===
  W(AP endpoint) = 0.334695  vs product (6/7)^7 = 0.339917  gap = -0.005222
  (all 21 pair correlations are >= 0 by THM-638, yet the 7-fold product bound fails at the AP:
   pairwise association does not extend to full association -- the LP/cherry layer is genuinely needed)
